To run the MATLAB scripts follow these steps:

1. Download any of the zip folders.
2. Upload or add the zip folder to MATLAB. 
3. Go to the folder (or directory), and run the MAIN ".m" script (e.g.: MC_MOTOR_sand_2cycles.m )
4. After you run the main script the MATLAB code will plot the results.
5. You can save the plot as a figure (.png)
